REM Paste into: Properties > Program > Advanced > "Specify a new MS-DOS configuration" > Configuration... (Config.sys box).
REM Real-mode + protected-mode SC-55 with JEMM. Applies ONLY to the MS-DOS-mode shortcut; your real CONFIG.SYS is not changed.
REM JEMMEX provides XMS and EMM. Remove NOEMS if a game needs EMS. X2MAX=8192 limits XMS to 8 MB (some real-mode games need that).
DEVICE=C:\SC55\RM\JEMM\JEMMEX.EXE X2MAX=8192 NOEMS
DOS=HIGH,UMB
REM Alternative with separate managers (use instead of the JEMMEX line; HIMEM.SYS is the one that comes with Windows 98):
REM DEVICE=C:\WINDOWS\HIMEM.SYS
REM DEVICE=C:\SC55\RM\JEMM\JEMM386.EXE NOEMS
REM Optional real CD-ROM (see CDROM-D810.TXT):
REM DEVICEHIGH=C:\SC55\CDDRV\XCDROM.SYS /D:XCD0001 /UX

REM LASTDRIVE=Z leaves room for the virtual CD drive M: (CD images, CDON.BAT).
LASTDRIVE=Z
